{"title":"2024 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2024 AMC 10B #2</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2024 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2024 AMC 12B #2</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_Apex_STEM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by Apex STEM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_Pi_Academy_(Fast_and_Easy_⚡🚀)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by Pi Academy (Fast and Easy ⚡🚀)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_the_BeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by the BeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/6/5b6f72525a5724bc4d8458a8d9276b64563ef7a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10! - 7! \\cdot 6!?$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"97\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/6/be6458fd1ee89caf9245e1b585d3f185ddf1300c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } -120 \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 0 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 120 \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 600 \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 720$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"450\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/1/b8144a2dae676a50347f02c7718b8a4121e95ab9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10! = 10 \\cdot 9 \\cdot 8 \\cdot 7! = 720 \\cdot 7!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"218\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/d/c5dda709e100ca60c9b550105d9c45880b87ec37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6! \\cdot 7! = 720 \\cdot 7!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"122\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, the equation is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/6/db6fb2736cd6cf9abd7ffb7458c2f9841e939786.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$720 \\cdot 7! - 720 \\cdot 7! = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"213\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>[ONLY FOR CERTAIN CHINESE TESTPAPERS]\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/6/f6644d6bba94f79f0a2e5490c70f552dc44c8cad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 - 5! = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }-120}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"168\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~Aray10 (Main Solution) and RULE101 (Modifications for certain China test papers)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Factoring out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/1/ce11f9bca5e74ba532323e045b62e2793d120b7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7!$\" width=\"12\" height=\"13\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/5/7959487d7c87c80b5d44388840d0a0c2c3a179e2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[7!(10\\cdot9\\cdot8-1\\cdot6!).\\]\" width=\"152\" height=\"18\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/2/1f2870f0df4e2bf6fbcb4a26cd90510a597f209d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\cdot9\\cdot8=6!=720$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"154\" height=\"14\" />, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/5/755d9fb89235fdc3e9d2a70bbb3d366facc0b12d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(B) }0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"52\" height=\"30\" /> \n</p><p>Factoring <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/6/e26ca46a67d19ce2e5b692103305a083a2361fd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6!$\" width=\"12\" height=\"13\" /> also works, it just makes the expression in the parenthesis a little harder to compute.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/a/e5a982702a4c72ce2052f64fa4bf163cb68f9de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10! - 7! \\cdot 6!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"16\" /> must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/c/40c37daf33163322c9c5baee740c27c080cbaaf0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[10! - 7! \\cdot 6!=7!(10\\cdot9\\cdot8\\cdot6!)=7\\cdot(6!\\cdot10\\cdot9\\cdot8\\cdot6!)\\]\" width=\"404\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/5/755d9fb89235fdc3e9d2a70bbb3d366facc0b12d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(B) }0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"52\" height=\"30\" /> is the only option divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/a/e5a982702a4c72ce2052f64fa4bf163cb68f9de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10! - 7! \\cdot 6!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"16\" /> can be split into two parts, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/2/c824ea490ff073932a1c17d8ce0b9a4215f90d95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10!$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/3/8f37d2ca73efad60bad5dc6dd16c68d020f0425d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7! \\cdot 6!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />. \nWe can break the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/6/e26ca46a67d19ce2e5b692103305a083a2361fd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6!$\" width=\"12\" height=\"13\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/0/bd0649330ca027df85cc1eec6ec033932c82f295.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2 \\cdot 4)(3 \\cdot 5 \\cdot 6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"115\" height=\"20\" />\nThe <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/3/303b4e2107e551d145ef2cd9edda98f51e373d2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\cdot 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" /> part makes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/9/7396ec5c39bcd849d3d9545795955eac2ab93aa6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\cdot 5 \\cdot 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" /> part makes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/a/0fa6989d476911a243af663b3cc6a411aef94ba4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 \\cdot 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"13\" />. \nWe still have the 7!, and we can multiply it by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/c/e2cd9681fc7c16e716b12537be1ca3b5ce24fdae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\cdot 9 \\cdot 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" />. This is clearly equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/2/c824ea490ff073932a1c17d8ce0b9a4215f90d95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10!$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" />, so our solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/1/b1113ff5876fba4116a0ae404550972a6d0cad00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10! - 10! =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/5/755d9fb89235fdc3e9d2a70bbb3d366facc0b12d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(B) }0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"52\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/4/254fc964ae7adf6622d6488cdf4c8537dd77c715.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10! = 3,628,800$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/8/49806920db12d6e8e0fa11973375762d9ef76879.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7! = 5,040$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/e/e7eda87c94b57e1e5b8a10651948bccba5bf6e0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6! = 720$\" width=\"65\" height=\"13\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/1/661f9dc2000fdac35de3d36263a179436d184c27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5,040 \\cdot 720 = 3,628,800$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"191\" height=\"17\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/e/3aeceddbcc377f5dc89980d335d5bb3f3217f552.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3,628,800 - 3,628,800 = \\boxed{\\text{(B) }0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"258\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>-pepper2831\n</p><p>-minor edits by blakezhang\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Apex_STEM\">Video Solution 1 by Apex STEM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by Apex STEM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/snAUYRQtRwA\">https://youtu.be/snAUYRQtRwA</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Pi_Academy_.28Fast_and_Easy_.E2.9A.A1.F0.9F.9A.80.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Pi_Academy_(Fast_and_Easy_⚡🚀)\">Video Solution 1 by Pi Academy (Fast and Easy ⚡🚀)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by Pi Academy (Fast and Easy ⚡🚀)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/DIl3rLQQkQQ?feature=shared\">https://youtu.be/DIl3rLQQkQQ?feature=shared</a>\n</p><p>~ Pi Academy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2_by_SpreadTheMathLove\">Video Solution 2 by SpreadTheMathLove</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2 by SpreadTheMathLove\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=24EZaeAThuE\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=24EZaeAThuE</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/DVlOz24jWuo\">https://youtu.be/DVlOz24jWuo</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_the_BeautyofMath\">Video Solution by the BeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by the BeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/mpnm_r6D3-w?t=373\">https://youtu.be/mpnm_r6D3-w?t=373</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\